{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2021-03-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT PARTNERS WITH HABITAT FOR HUMANITY TO HELP COMMUNITIES "BRING ON SPRING"', 'text': "ATLANTA, MARCH 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE HOME DEPOT®, THE WORLD'S LARGEST HOME IMPROVEMENT RETAILER, ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH HABITAT FOR HUMANITY INTERNATIONAL TO EMPOWER COMMUNITIES TO BRING ON SPRING. PROVIDING MORE THAN $200,0000 IN PRODUCTS, THE HOME DEPOT WILL GIVE HABITAT FOR HUMANITY ORGANIZATIONS ACROSS THE COUNTRY THE TOOLS NEEDED TO HELP LOCAL COMMUNITIES TACKLE SPRING DIY PROJECTS AND NEIGHBORHOOD REVITALIZATION EFFORTS."}